OL,3,GNEWSAEleven arrested at pro-Palestinian
OL,4,Amarches in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FEleven people were arrested at several
OL,7,Fpro-Palestinian demonstrations held in
OL,8,FLondon on Wednesday.
OL,10,FAmong them were five people arrested on
OL,11,Fsuspicion of inciting racial hatred at
OL,12,Fa protest outside the office of the
OL,13,FBoard of Deputies of British Jews in
OL,14,Fnorth London, the Metropolitan Police
OL,15,Fsaid.
OL,17,FThe force said the other arrests were
OL,18,Fmade at student pro-Palestinian
OL,19,Fprotests elsewhere in the capital,
OL,20,Fwhich were held despite calls for them
OL,21,Fto be postponed.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
