OL,3,GNEWSAEleven arrested at pro-Palestinian
OL,4,Amarches in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FWednesday marked three years since the
OL,7,F7 October attack on Israel by Hamas, in
OL,8,Fwhich around 1,200 people were killed
OL,9,Fand 251 others were taken as hostages
OL,10,Fby the militant group.
